From 0c1a828a17902adcf179830473be56c3a18866a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 20:25:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(lyrics): add floating lyrics overlay

Show the current and next lyric line in a system overlay while music
plays and ECHO is in the background. The overlay can be dragged
vertically, locked for click-through (window alpha 0.8 for Android 12+
touch pass-through), and resized from Settings > Playback > Lyrics.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
